]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, February to March and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 153% of normal for July to August and 25% of normal for November to December. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 20% of normal on the middle. Grid 25329 had its driest year in 2012, at 56% of normal.</p>"}
